meta {
  name: 03 - Power Station List
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url_sungrow}}/openapi/getPowerStationList
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  x-access-key: {{sungrow_secret_key}}
  Authorization: Bearer {{sungrow_access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "appkey": "{{sungrow_appkey}}",
    "sys_code": "901",
    "lang": "_en_US",
    "curPage": 1,
    "size": 10
  }
}

docs {
  Ejemplo de endpoint de datos: lista de plantas.
  Requiere access_token (Bearer) + x-access-key + appkey en el body.
  sys_code 901 = acceso web/openapi. Ajusta curPage/size segun necesites.
  (Verifica el path exacto en el developer portal si Sungrow devuelve error de endpoint.)
}
